# .gitignore
#
# These rules only affect UNTRACKED files - git keeps tracking whatever is already in the index.
#
# Reconciliation note (item 24 of IMPROVEMENTS.md): several of the paths below are ALSO tracked
# in this repo (dist/, dontinclude/, update.bat, x.bat). The contradiction is resolved here by
# stating it explicitly and by un-ignoring the two tracked .bat files; actually untracking them
# would be a deletion, which decision D2 puts out of scope.

notes.txt
everythingelse

# scratch / generated dirs - these still keep NEW untracked files out of the repo
sub/
server/
dist/
dontinclude/

# local helper scripts are ignored, except the two that are tracked in this repo
*.bat
!update.bat
!x.bat
